  "prompt": "Cho tam giác đều <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cạnh bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math>. Tính độ dài của các véc-tơ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.",
  "choices": [],
